section#contact
	.wrapper
		.section-heading.reveal-on-scroll
			span.section-heading__tag 06. Contact
			h2.section-heading__title
				| Get in
				span.highlight Touch
			p.section-heading__subtitle
				| Let's discuss engineering architecture, technical leadership, or new frontend opportunities.

		.contact-card.reveal-on-scroll
			//- .contact-card__badge
			//- 	span.status-dot
			//- 	span Open to Opportunities &bull; Diemen / Amsterdam

			h3.contact-card__title Let's build something exceptional together

			p.contact-card__text
				| Whether you have a challenging frontend architecture challenge, a question about my experience, or just want to connect — my inbox is always open.

			.contact-card__email-box
				span.contact-card__email-text chekitdnb@gmail.com
				button.btn.btn-primary.btn-sm(type="button", data-copy-email="chekitdnb@gmail.com", aria-label="Copy email to clipboard")
					svg.svg-icon(viewBox="0 0 24 24", width="14", height="14")
						path(d="M16 1H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v14h2V3h12V1zm3 4H8c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v14c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h11c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V7c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm0 16H8V7h11v14z")
					| Copy Email
				a.btn.btn-secondary.btn-sm(href="mailto:chekitdnb@gmail.com")
					| Send Mail &rarr;

